r": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "super hard at first, but i just couldn't get enough. still keep on playing trying to unlock all the characters and items. awesome game to play for a few hours every now and then.", "timestamp_created": 1402812197, "timestamp_updated": 1402812197, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10478375", "author": {"steamid": "76561198062102702", "personaname": "Roikus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198062102702/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2956, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1893, "last_played": 1685486157, "avatar": "2834f126af8599dfb08648d2ec429333767ed58c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome game. \nWhen I started playing Risk of Rain, I told myself I would never be able to finish it. It is hard, really hard. Then you get to unlock a new character and you realize you have almost a new game. The gameplay is great, the characters are great and the music is amazing (really amazing). This game is one that makes you realize that you don't need 20 persons working on a game to make something special. Risk of Rain, you are in my favorite list, next to the Binding of Isaac.\n\nBest \n\nRoikus", "timestamp_created": 1402810095, "timestamp_updated": 1402810419, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10478194", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993992608", "personaname": "gay moth aunt", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gaymothaunt/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 96, "playtime_forever": 8387, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4136, "last_played": 1587062367, "avatar": "4f64e4aa478edc0b178d511320055aafcd2f998f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Shoot a hell of a lot of things. Or beat them up.\nThis is the kind of \"fling giant hordes of crap at the player constantly and let them learn how to deal with it\" gameplay I like, also seen in stuff like Gunstar Heroes. The twist of the game getting more and more pissed off as you take longer is a unique twist on it, too. The achievements system works out pretty well too - you unlock more content as you complete challenges.\nGotten a lot of mileage out of this one for how much I paid. Great value.", "timestamp_created": 1402808143, "timestamp_updated": 1402808143, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.485356897115707397", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10477418", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032619654", "personaname": "Hoot.avi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hootavi/", "num_games_owned": 749, "num_reviews": 116, "playtime_forever": 2125, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 654, "last_played": 1728796049, "avatar": "7ba64cc9124a64f43c1ed61e96a1d9361d86d531"}, "language": "english", "review": "Me and my friend played through beginning to end, go to the highest difficulty, and won. Most intense game of our lives, definitely a 10/10 in the gameplay department.\nWould recommend again.", "timestamp_created": 1402800572, "timestamp_updated": 1402800572, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.51754385232925415", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10475691", "author": {"steamid": "76561198007436876", "personaname": "Murk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Malist/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 912, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 239, "last_played": 1447981665, "avatar": "0e26a238d8613c28465c274047405cc767c00044"}, "language": "english", "review": "Challenging game.\nFun with others \"I've only played with one other person\"\nA lot of references to other modern pop culture.\nLack of Rule 34.\n\nEdit:Yo, I'm 26 years old now, what the ♥♥♥♥ did I review.\n\nI played it again for hours, if you can manage with rogue likes, game's pretty baller and offers a different experience each time.", "timestamp_created": 1402785460, "timestamp_updated": 1604873472, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}